WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
Find a braider at Cornell, all in one place.

00:02.900 --> 00:08.400
Browse braiders with their styles and starting prices upfront.

00:08.400 --> 00:13.400
Filter by the style you want, like box braids.

00:13.400 --> 00:17.500
Open a profile to see their work and prices.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.300
Read reviews from past clients, then choose a style and a date.

00:22.300 --> 00:29.200
Only times that fit the style are shown. Pick one.

00:29.200 --> 00:32.600
Add a note about length, color or inspiration.

00:32.600 --> 00:35.400
Send the request. It lands under My bookings, with the cancel policy and what to bring.
